  If I knew㉔<I>where</I>㉓in that massive frame the cockpit is located, I could work around it. As is, however, I would be entrusting the pilot's fate to luck.

  That would not be a problem if the target were an infected musha. I decided years ago to kill them without hesitation or mercy, simply because there is no other way to prevent Ginseigo from multiplying.

//　だが、あれは違うのだ。殺す事はできない。
//　あれはあれで罪があるのかもしれない――おそらく
