"Similar research was being conducted by the Allied Forces, but we determined that the cannon would be too large and require too much energy to mount on a mobile weapons platform."

//【ガーゲット】
<voice name='ガーゲット' class='ガーゲット' src='voice/ma04/013vs0910b02'>
//「それを、機動兵器の方を大型化することで
//解決するとは……素晴らしく大雑把な手法だ。
//　島国の未開人なればこそだな。我々文明人
//であれば冗談の種で済ませてしまうところだ」
"But you've solved that problem by enlarging the platform, rather than by miniaturizing the weapon. A splendidly crude idea, the sort of which only a primitive mind could conceive. It would have been laughed off in civilized circles."

//【研究所長】
<voice name='研究所長' class='研究所長' src='voice/ma04/013vs0920b22'>
//「ぐぉアーーー!!」
"Gahhhh!"

//【ガーゲット】
<voice name='ガーゲット' class='ガーゲット' src='voice/ma04/013vs0930b02'>
//「感激するのは良いが騒がしいのは困るな、
