"That...㉓<I>thing</I>㉑is a tsurugi, is it not? How did you forge something so absurdly massive? I've never heard of anything remotely like it."

//【研究所長】
<voice name='研究所長' class='研究所長' src='voice/ma04/013vs0980b22'>
//「……そいつは俺も知らねぇー。
