"When we checked it out, we discovered it was hundreds, maybe thousands of years old. Someone forged it for an <I>armored musha</I> to wear. Everyone shit their pants, let me tell you."

//【研究所長】
<voice name='研究所長' class='研究所長' src='voice/ma04/013vs1050b22'>
//「劔冑の上に劔冑を重ねる、なんつー発想は
