"No one ever imagined you could layer tsurugi one on top of another like that.
  Anyway, Rokuhara claimed the find and started research, hoping it'd lead to improvements in dragoon armor."

//【研究所長】
<voice name='研究所長' class='研究所長' src='voice/ma04/013vs1060b22'>
//「けど結局、製造法はわからんかった。
